#uuid "196f0467-aa9a-5dc4-9f2d-a092284d7726" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{252(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245/field-4/f4222263ee058178a978f4d8b73d76c30ee483e6713327b01a6b321164347b19" :answer/id #uuid "27bba06c-d9a4-51c7-b91c-fbb24dcd41e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "ee6f0836-26e1-5dfb-bc98-d28b73bc1c01" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343245/field-4/614577b1ce2cf80d633915d91d0fa9cd0f4ecb6f82516cc7815b341f4a1cf468" :answer-field/choices ["q-343245/field-4/e441c9ef661e1094410ce7b1e9b7328916317394ef02b3c625e009ca5538b73e" "q-343245/field-4/614577b1ce2cf80d633915d91d0fa9cd0f4ecb6f82516cc7815b341f4a1cf468" "q-343245/field-4/cd157d02e694b28b3c76b07e83a752faa0ea388c4ee520403e5b306f57d127c1" "q-343245/field-4/f4222263ee058178a978f4d8b73d76c30ee483e6713327b01a6b321164347b19"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245/field-5/4f1cc41f8ce9a3ee526cae63a3c1c702a1e792404302f4907ff1b52447a8e94f" :answer/id #uuid "0d2923b5-c519-5424-b6bb-4cf87a97ea9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245/field-5/02ed36065101387bcf15b45d2220bec17bd5ee8469eadf19e4c6f098cb65b0a2" :answer/id #uuid "4ef6f471-8351-5c50-a2e4-1b507d5c8afd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245/field-5" :answer-field/id #uuid "a2ef6fba-db58-5439-a0bb-804487d34f31" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343245/field-5/02ed36065101387bcf15b45d2220bec17bd5ee8469eadf19e4c6f098cb65b0a2" :answer-field/choices ["q-343245/field-5/4f1cc41f8ce9a3ee526cae63a3c1c702a1e792404302f4907ff1b52447a8e94f" "q-343245/field-5/02ed36065101387bcf15b45d2220bec17bd5ee8469eadf19e4c6f098cb65b0a2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343245" :question/id #uuid "6d18e00a-46f0-53e8-8f7c-935fda52873e" :question/math-academy-id "q-343245" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $6$-periodic extension of the function $F(x)=-7{x}^{2}+4$ defined on $[-3,3).$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below, showing the derivation of the Fourier series of the $6$-periodic extension of $G(x)=-14x$ from the corresponding Fourier series of $f(x).$The Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\n-7{x}^{2}+4∼-17+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f$ is \n{{field-2}}\nand\n{{field-3}}\non $R,$ we may differentiate its Fourier series term-by-term to get\n\n$$\n-14x∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{{field-4}}\\cdot {{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $F(x)$ is an even function. So, the Fourier series of its $2L$-periodic extension has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=3$ and we are already given the coefficients ${a}_{0}$ and ${a}_{n}$ for $n\\ge 1.$ Thus, the Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼-17+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that \n\n- the function $F$ is continuously differentiable on $(-3,3),$\n\n- continuous on $[-3,3),$ and\n\n- satisfies $F(-3)=F(3),$ if we extend the value at $x=3$ using the formula $F(x)=-7{x}^{2}+4.$\n\nTherefore, the $6$-periodic extension $f$ is $\\text{continuous}$ and $\\text{piecewise smooth}$ on $R,$ so we may differentiate its Fourier series term-by-term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7{x}^{2}+4) & ∼\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-17)+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\ -14x & ∼0+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{252(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\cdot (-\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\ -14x & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{-84(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\ -14x & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{84(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi }\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343245/field-1" "q-343245/field-2" "q-343245/field-3" "q-343245/field-4" "q-343245/field-5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2e37d37-007c-569b-a44c-cb6a9d075371"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343245"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343251/field-1/02ed36065101387bcf15b45d2220bec17bd5ee8469eadf19e4c6f098cb65b0a2" :answer/id #uuid "701acf4a-cb36-5287-b251-629fb97184d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343251/field-1/a60fe99f250bf026e1c7e8c51252c9d47144bc8d638ae3a550b75955f68ead3c" :answer/id #uuid "9c57a2a0-1962-5892-a254-1371c876ca25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343251/field-1/4f1cc41f8ce9a3ee526cae63a3c1c702a1e792404302f4907ff1b52447a8e94f" :answer/id #uuid "cc71cb98-c029-5878-bc01-80dfe69cab2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343251/field-1/22a4d37d0983a97aab87b95b41a1b53a971b64398f3ee073e7ac40da0c14e126" :answer/id #uuid "04dc5c9f-aff0-52e6-b5cb-39e3ded5ec7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343251/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "102ed9a9-0430-5250-b464-aa8b7154769a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.typ